Package: C.SamcPackage
Type: Package
Title: SAMC Simulation Package using C code and Rcpp
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Dayeon", "Kim", email = "dayun0405@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Runs Example 1 from Liang, Liu and Carroll (2007),
    "Stochastic Approximation in Monte Carlo Computation" (Journal of the
    American Statistical Association, 102(477), 305-320) in C, exposed to
    R through 'Rcpp'. This is the fastest of the three language backends
    in this repository; see also 'R.SamcPackage' for the pure R reference
    implementation.
